Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯开源浏览器自动化工具BrowserSkill，赋能AI智能体独立执行网页任务</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI完成70亿美元员工股份回购，估值维持8520亿美元</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta开源30B参数模型Muse Glimmer，支持消费级硬件本地运行AI Agent</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达联合六大金融机构筹集超5000亿美元建设AI算力融资平台</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62b9e13e0dbd0f3c9f62b9537b1ee823.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">8月11日，英伟达宣布与Apollo、贝莱德、黑石、博枫、高盛和KKR六家金融机构达成合作，共同建立独立的算力融资平台，旨在为全球AI基础设施建设筹集超过5000亿美元的第三方资本。英伟达已于8月10日签署谅解备忘录，待最终协议生效后，该平台将通过设立大规模资金池，以具备竞争力的融资利率，向企业、云服务商及AI开发机构提供资金支持。此举旨在缓解客户在数据中心、GPU集群及能源配套建设中的巨额资本压力，加速AI“工厂”的规模化扩张。随着生成式AI模型训练与推理需求激增，英伟达此举标志着AI产业竞争已从单纯的模型与芯片技术层面，深度延伸至算力基础设施与金融资本体系的协同建设，通过降低融资门槛，进一步巩固其在AI算力生态中的核心地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布首款开源全双工语音模型NemotronLabs VoiceChat 11B</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达正式推出首款开源端到端全双工语音对话模型NemotronLabs VoiceChat 11B。该模型摒弃了传统ASR、LLM与TTS分步架构，采用统一网络实现流式语音理解与生成，平滑轮换延迟低至448毫秒，支持边听边说的全双工交互及中途插话响应。作为首个支持对话中工具调用的开源全双工模型，其引入独立输出通道与预置“保持”话术机制，在处理外部API请求时可自动触发过渡台词，避免静默。目前该模型仅限研究用途，部署需单张至少80GB显存的高性能GPU，暂未提供托管API。其开放权重与容器设计为联络中心、汽车座舱及智能无障碍辅助等领域的开发者提供了底层架构参考，但在长上下文及多轮对话场景下仍存在局限性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯开源浏览器自动化工具BrowserSkill，赋能AI智能体独立执行网页任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/622ef85c5eea4801a5ac77e28f2d3f6a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正式开源专为AI Agent设计的浏览器自动化工具BrowserSkill，旨在解决智能体处理网页任务的效率痛点。该工具区别于传统大模型插件，具备三大核心优势：一是支持复用浏览器真实登录状态，无需重复验证；二是采用独立窗口执行指令，不干扰用户当前工作流；三是通过简洁的bsk命令行工具（CLI），实现与Claude Code、Codex及Workbuddy等主流智能体的无缝接入。在技术架构上，BrowserSkill采用CLI独立驱动与扩展中介设计，模型无需直接识别复杂网页底层元素，显著提升了执行速度与稳定性。实测显示，该工具可高效完成知乎话题搜索、社交平台评论抓取及情绪画像生成等任务。BrowserSkill的推出打通了AI智能体与真实网络交互的“最后一公里”，为开发者实现多任务并行处理提供了全新的技术路径</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI完成70亿美元员工股份回购，估值维持8520亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/730c66fd8008a8495148a3d15a35b002.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI近日完成了一项约70亿美元的员工股份回购交易，此次回购由公司直接出资，未引入外部投资者。交易对OpenAI的估值维持在8520亿美元，与今年3月的融资估值持平。此次大规模回购旨在为员工提供套现渠道，但也暗示其IPO进程可能延后。尽管OpenAI已于今年6月向美国证券交易委员会秘密提交IPO文件，但面对营收未达预期及CEO奥尔特曼承认的业绩压力，公司选择通过回购规避上市复杂性。在Anthropic等竞争对手盈利压力下，OpenAI正通过削减业务投入、聚焦企业服务等战略调整蓄力。此次回购既是留住核心人才的筹码，也反映出公司在财务数据未达最优状态前，倾向于延长私有化阶段以换取更稳健的长期增长。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta开源30B参数模型Muse Glimmer，支持消费级硬件本地运行AI Agent</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta于8月10日正式开源300亿参数模型Muse Glimmer，作为今年4月发布的封闭模型Muse Spark的开放版本，采用Apache 2.0许可证。该模型专为消费级硬件上的本地AI Agent设计，支持在配备单块消费级GPU的Mac或PC上离线运行。Muse Glimmer具备多步骤代理能力，可执行工具调用、代码编写调试、文件处理及屏幕截图分析，并支持文本与图像输入，训练覆盖100多种语言。Meta旨在通过该模型实现“始终在线”的个人超级智能，通过本地化处理个人数据以强化隐私保护。尽管Meta采取分层策略，保留了能力更强的Muse Spark作为闭源模型，但Muse Glimmer的发布为开发者提供了构建可负担、高性能本地AI助手的关键工具，进一步推动了个人AI Agent在消费级设备上的普及。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
